# Phased Delivery Plan

Work one phase at a time. Audit current state before implementing. Never skip ahead with half-finished prior phases.

## Phase 1 — Architecture Audit

Map routes, models, controllers, services, env vars, and broken/missing integrations. Document gaps vs spec. No feature work until audit is done.

## Phase 2 — Design System

Inter font, color tokens, shared UI in `client/src/components/ui/`, layout shells (FeedLayout, sidebars, bottom nav). Remove gradient/glassmorphism anti-patterns.

## Phase 3 — Community Feed

Default landing = community feed. Infinite scroll + skeleton loading + pagination fallback. Report card, issue posts, right insights sidebar, real-time prepend on new issues.

## Phase 4 — Reporting + AI

Anonymous report flow: photo/camera, location, category, AI analysis, complaint ID, track complaint. Citizen AI summary; admin AI diagnostics.

## Phase 5 — Admin Dashboard

JWT auth, analytics, issue queue, AI review, department assignment, status updates, resolution upload (before/after), performance metrics.

## Phase 6 — Real-Time

Socket.IO for status updates, support counts, comments, notifications, live admin changes. Optimistic UI where safe.

## Phase 7 — Testing + Deployment

`npm install`, start all services, verify MongoDB/APIs/OpenAI/Cloudinary/Maps/Socket.IO, run build, fix all errors, validate citizen + admin flows end-to-end.

## Validation Flows

**Citizen:** Home → Feed → View Issue → Support → Comment → Report → Upload → Location → AI → Submit → Complaint ID → Track

**Admin:** Login → Dashboard → Review AI → Assign → Update Status → Upload Resolution → Resolved → Citizen live update
